WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.661
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind early computer generations.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.843
Vacuum tube: was used in many first-generation computers. Transistor: replaced vacuum

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:14.256
tubes in many later machines.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:19.712
Integrated circuit: combined electronic parts on a chip. Microprocessor: puts

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:25.686
processing circuitry onto a chip. Personal computer: is designed for use by an

00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:26.146
individual.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:32.475
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of vacuum tube, transistor and

00:00:32.475 --> 00:00:36.422
integrated circuit. Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
